label FIRST
Postmaster: Welcome! I'm Postmaster General around these here parts.
- Thanks!
	label Enjoy the game sir!
	[end_timeline]

- Fuck off!
	jump SHOOT

[end_timeline]


label STANDARD
if {game_has_started} == false:
	Postmaster: Welcome back sir! Enjoy the game!

elif {game_has_started} == true:
	Postmaster: Hello sir! what services can I offer you?
	- Nothing right now.
		[end_timeline]
	- I'd like to buy a stamp please
		Postmaster: Of course! That will be 150 gold please.
		- I'm sorry, I don't have enough money. | [if {InventoryManager.current_currency} <= 150.0] [else="hide"]
			jump SHOOT
		- Here you go! (pay 150 gold) | [if {InventoryManager.current_currency} >= 150.0] [else="hide"]
			do InventoryManager.decrease_currency(150.0)
			set {InventoryManager.has_postage} = true
			jump STANDARD
		- Actually, lets go back real quick.
			Postmaster: Sure thing.
			jump STANDARD
	- I'd like to mail a silver frog to the king of the elves please.
		Postmaster: Of course sir. Please offer your frog and your postage.
		- Uhhhh, I don't actually have a frog.
			jump SHOOT
		- Uhhhh, I don't actually have a stamp.
			jump SHOOT
		- Here you go! | [if {InventoryManager.has_frog} == true && {InventoryManager.has_postage} == true] [else="disable"]
			set {InventoryManager.has_frog} = false
			set {InventoryManager.has_postage} = false
			[signal arg="WIN_GAME"]
		- Actually, lets go back real quick.
			Postmaster: Sure thing.
			jump STANDARD
[end_timeline]


label SHOOT
Postmaster: WHAT THE FUCK DID YOU SAY TO ME YOU LITTLE BITCH
Postmaster: I'm shooting you with a gun! I'm killing you!
[signal arg="POSTMASTER_SHOOT"]